      <h2 class="m3-pl-row__heading">FASARA™ — Frosted, etched, and branded glass aesthetics without the replacement cost</h2>
      <p class="m3-pl-row__body">Sandblasted or etched glass looks sharp — but it's permanent, expensive, and impossible to update when your branding changes. 3M FASARA™ Glass Finishes are decorative window and glass films available in over 100 patterns: frosted, matte, geometric, translucent, and custom-printed. Applied to the interior glass surface, they deliver the same visual effect at a fraction of the cost and can be removed or updated at any time. Because FASARA™ transmits diffused light rather than blocking it entirely, spaces stay bright while gaining full visual privacy.</p>
